; expect 46
; In a type with both nullary and fieldful constructors, every value
; is a heap block - stage0 unboxes nullary constructors to immediate
; tags only when the WHOLE type is nullary. Treating `(None4)` as a
; bare integer made the `(Just4 x)` arm's tag load dereference it:
; SIGSEGV. 40 + 6.
(data M4 (None4) (Just4 Int))
(:: g (-> M4 Int))
(fn (g m) (match m ((Just4 x) (+ x 1)) ((None4) 40)))
(:: main Int)
(fn (main) (+ (g (None4)) (g (Just4 5))))
